      ":question/problem": "![](images/59/59772d8478ac4248bae261089b0834b673786adca0d8b5d541764fe002b8fe15.png)\n\nA Turing machine is given by the transition table below, and at the current moment, it's in the configuration depicted above. Which of the following shows the machine's configuration after applying two steps?\n\n| $_{Q}\u2216^{\u0393}$ | $0$ | $1$ | $\u25fb$ |\n| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: |\n| $\u2192 q_{1}$ | $(q_{1}, 1, R)$ | $(q_{1}, 0, R)$ | $(q_{2}, \u25fb, L)$ |\n| $q_{2}$ | $(q_{2}, 1, L)$ | $(q_{2}, 0, L)$ | $(q_{0}, \u25fb, R)$ |\n| $\u2217q_{0}$ | $-$ | $-$ | $-$ |"
